          "id": 588310326,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "\"arm64\" looks good to me. Would \"Wireshark x.y.z ARM 64.dmg\" make sense for the package filename? \"Wireshark x.y.z Apple Silicon 64.dmg\" seems a bit long.",
