        {
          "id": 588566064,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "The company that licensed the instruction set to Apple [would probably prefer \"Wireshark x.y.z Arm 64.dmg\"](https://www.arm.com/company/policies/trademarks).",
          "author": {
            "id": 5636682,
            "username": "guyharris",
