          "body": "added 7 commits\n\n<ul><li>1c3220b7...1e467963 - 4 commits from branch <code>wireshark:master</code></li><li>67c7bcc5 - ui: add support for updating on macOS using arm</li><li>9494cf40 - ui: update comment</li><li>3817b420 - ui: use arm64 instead of arm-64 as suggested by Guy</li></ul>\n\n[Compare with previous version](/wireshark/wireshark/-/merge_requests/3177/diffs?diff_id=192933593&start_sha=1c3220b7fd6e4306d8c24f50c7730a03d48f9a63)",
